										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<strong>Skift Take: The fight over Heathrow&apos;s third runway has been about whether it fits net zero. Lawmakers have now added a more basic question: who pays, and how much ends up in fares? Until ministers can answer that, and price in the cost of cutting emissions, the plan is stalled.</strong><br/><br/><p><a href="https://skift.com/2026/11/26/heathrows-third-runway-has-a-25-billion-problem-before-it-gets-to-emissions/">Read the Complete Story On Skift</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
